Milo: Welcome to Tartaria, Keeper.
Milo: The Aether flows strong here... can you feel it?

<<declare $rs = 0>>

-> I feel something... (Curious)
    Milo: Good. Your resonance is awakening.
    <<set $rs to 10>>
-> I don't sense anything. (Skeptical)
    Milo: Patience. The frequency will find you.
    <<set $rs to 5>>

<<if $rs > 7>>
    Milo: Your connection is strong. The Star Dome awaits.
<<else>>
    Milo: We must attune you first. Follow me.
<<endif>>

Milo: Together, we'll restore what was lost.
